WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.171 --> 00:00:02.559
Please welcome, Kumail Nanjiani,

00:00:02.559 --> 00:00:04.299
Olivia Munn, Dave Franco,

00:00:04.299 --> 00:00:06.998
