00:00:08.789 --> 00:00:12.956
(audience applause and theatrical music)

00:00:38.019 --> 00:00:39.291
[Conan] Have a seat, please!

00:00:39.291 --> 00:00:42.291
(audience applause)

00:00:46.616 --> 00:00:48.771
You can have whatever you want.

00:00:48.771 --> 00:00:52.160
Please, everybody, please for God's sake.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:53.680
[Kumail] Oh my God!

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:54.513
(audience cheering)

00:00:54.513 --> 00:00:55.346
Nice seating by the way.

00:01:04.379 --> 00:01:05.212
(laughing)

00:01:05.212 --> 00:01:07.960
My chair is, I can't get
it to stay the right ...

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:10.051
[Andy] These stools are designed

00:01:10.051 --> 00:01:12.709
to make you feel
uncomfortable and insecure.

00:01:12.709 --> 00:01:13.659
(laughing)

00:01:13.659 --> 00:01:14.589
[Zach] I feel like I have an inert--

00:01:14.589 --> 00:01:15.539
[Kumail] Have I been sitting

00:01:15.539 --> 00:01:16.576
on these stools my whole life?

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:17.657
(laughing)

00:01:17.657 --> 00:01:18.617
Alright well let's start with you, Kumail,

00:01:18.617 --> 00:01:20.250
because you made it all
about you instantly.

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:22.771
(laughing)

00:01:22.771 --> 00:01:24.549
You've been to Comic-Con many times,

00:01:24.549 --> 00:01:26.840
what's your advice for
newbies at Comic-Con?

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:29.339
I would say, you know,

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:30.691
you gotta bring your A-game.

00:01:30.691 --> 00:01:31.909
You gotta have Purell.

00:01:31.909 --> 00:01:33.451
I carry Purell with me.

00:01:33.451 --> 00:01:36.034
Drink Purell, shower in Purell.

00:01:36.891 --> 00:01:38.699
And also the other thing
not many people know

00:01:38.699 --> 00:01:41.866
everyone in a mask is a celebrity, so.

00:01:43.419 --> 00:01:45.760
Just go up to them and
be like, whisper like,

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:47.739
"I know who you are."

00:01:47.739 --> 00:01:50.499
And then get them to sign
your Ninja Turtle lunch box.

00:01:50.499 --> 00:01:52.171
(audience laughs)
Yeah. Now what about,

00:01:52.171 --> 00:01:53.680
what else you noticing about Comic-Con?

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:54.851
You've been an old hand at this.

00:01:54.851 --> 00:01:55.888
What have you--

00:01:55.888 --> 00:01:58.509
Oh, you guys know what stink shoulder is?

00:01:58.509 --> 00:01:59.760
This is what stink shoulder is!

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:01.269
Okay, I was talking ...

00:02:01.269 --> 00:02:03.160
So you know, a lot of attractive women

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:05.650
will dress up as characters
and then dudes will be like,

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:07.339
"Can I get a picture with you?"

00:02:07.339 --> 00:02:09.010
And what they'll do is
they'll put their arm

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:13.009
around the lady, and their
armpit is in the girl's shoulder.

00:02:13.009 --> 00:02:13.959
(audience laughs)

00:02:13.959 --> 00:02:15.840
And so their shoulder starts stinking.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:18.539
It's called stink
shoulder, so these ladies,

00:02:18.539 --> 00:02:21.291
you'll see them, they'll be
like Purelling their shoulder.

00:02:21.291 --> 00:02:24.000
(audience laughs)

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.339
Now okay, Oliva, let's find
out if this is true or not.

00:02:27.339 --> 00:02:29.899
You've been to Comic-Con before

00:02:29.899 --> 00:02:31.739
you were dressed very nicely,

00:02:31.739 --> 00:02:33.619
you had a lot of dudes
putting their arm around you.

00:02:33.619 --> 00:02:35.699
Did you experience that?

00:02:35.699 --> 00:02:38.749
Yeah, I have been a
victim of stink shoulder.

00:02:38.749 --> 00:02:40.659
(audience laughs)

00:02:40.659 --> 00:02:42.768
It's something I--

00:02:42.768 --> 00:02:44.469
There you go.

00:02:44.469 --> 00:02:45.840
(audience laughs)

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:47.461
Let me.

00:02:47.461 --> 00:02:51.211
(audience laughs and cheers)

00:02:55.291 --> 00:02:56.701
I know, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:02:56.701 --> 00:02:58.291
[Zach] Now you have predator shoulder.

00:02:58.291 --> 00:02:59.320
(audience laughing)

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.600
Say that again?

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:01.861
[Zach] Now you have predator shoulder.

00:03:01.861 --> 00:03:04.438
(laughing)

00:03:04.438 --> 00:03:06.269
You guys, it just looks
like somebody just,

00:03:06.269 --> 00:03:07.569
you know, on my shoulder.

00:03:07.569 --> 00:03:10.000
(audience laughs)

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.541
[Kumail] That's a real stink shoulder.

00:03:11.541 --> 00:03:12.989
(laughing)

00:03:12.989 --> 00:03:14.269
[Conan] The invisible man.

00:03:14.269 --> 00:03:16.331
(audience laughs)

00:03:16.331 --> 00:03:19.498
The invisible man's been at it again!

